      "title": "秘密潜行·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23016001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "这里就是最后的地方了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23016002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "你是什么人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23016003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "嗯？竟然还有个手办吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23016004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "你要做什么——啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "都到这里了，还有手办把守吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "当然会有人把守。因为他就是这里的BOSS。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "米莉姆？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "你怎么在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "当然是被抓过来的。准备大闹的时候，这家伙想要让我配合他做一些试验。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "所以你就被抓起来了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "没错，因为他要给我好喝的涂料啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "不过你刚才说的BOSS是怎么回事？这家伙就是幕后的那个家伙？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "没错，顺便说明一下，这家伙是在装晕哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "……竟然被发现了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "没想到你一个人竟然能够闯到这种地方来……凭借就是你这奇怪的伪装能力吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "哼，难怪我那些手下一个都没有发现，真是一群蠢货。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "其实倒不是没发现——不过也无所谓了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "那么，boss先生，我有个问题要问问你。你知道这个面具吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这个面具……哼，你觉得我会告诉你吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23017016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "不要以为你们找到了这里，一切就算是结束了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-515",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
          "rowIds": [
            23016001,
            23016002,
            23016003,
            23016004
          ],
          "sectionId": 23016
        },
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
          "rowIds": [
            23017001,
            23017002,
            23017003,
            23017004,
            23017005,
            23017006,
