          ],
          "sectionId": 23017
        }
      ],
      "title": "秘密潜行·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23018001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "给我解决这个家伙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "你做了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这样显而易见的事情还用我说明吗，当然是控制了这个家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "你来晚了一步，这家伙比我想象的还听话，只是给她涂料，她就自己喝掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这家伙的战斗力倒是不错，先前我几个手下都被她打倒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "现在我用她来对付你，你要怎样应对呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "看来我好像没有选择了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23018009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "咕哇！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这两个家伙……实力这么旗鼓相当吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这都打了多久了，还没有分出胜负？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "米莉姆、利姆鲁，你们怎么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "什么人！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "哦，大家都来了呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "这样看来，那些人你们也都救走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "根据你留下的那些线索，我们已经把那些人质都送出去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "倒是你这边，需要我帮忙吗，米莉姆她……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "米莉姆，既然那些人已经被救了出去，就没必要再继续了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "这么快就……唔，总觉得还没玩够呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "喵大黄",
          "text": "这，这是……什么情况……你刚才是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "被骗了吗，被骗了吗？哇哈哈哈，刚才当然是米莉姆大人的演技了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "那种东西才没法控制我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "嘛。事情就是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "太早对你出手，说不定要被拿人质威胁，现在人都救走，就没必要有这些顾虑了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "虽然没怎么听明白，但总感觉……好像一切都被解决了的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "那么现在，这位BOSS先生，要不要考虑下和我们合作？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "老老实实说出你知道的消息，还有，关于这个面具你知道的一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "你是在找我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23019021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
